<title>UK: Burton says current sales up 7.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Burton says current sales up 7.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's second biggest clothing retailer Burton Group Plc said on Thursday trading in the first nine weeks of the current year, to November 2, had been encouraging, with sales up 7.8 percent.</p>
<p>Gross margins for the period were up by 1.1 percentage points.</p>
</text>
